 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon OpenSearch Service API (2021-01-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Domains are configuration records: no cluster, node, storage, endpoint, index, document or search exists, Endpoint is never returned, and UpdateDomainConfig, index, package, connection and VPC endpoint APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Only OpenSearch engine versions are accepted. VPC options, fine-grained access control and master-user credentials, Cognito and IAM Identity Center authentication, Auto-Tune and AI/ML options are refused; access policies are stored but not enforced. CreateDomain stores TagList, but AddTags, RemoveTags and ListTags are not implemented.",
  "title": "Amazon OpenSearch Service (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-01-01"
 },
